7-6&amp;rft.aulast=Roberts&amp;rft.aufirst=Gareth+Ffowc&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fbooks.google.com%2Fbooks%3Fid%3DwaCYEAAAQBAJ%26pg%3DPA102&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AHistory+of+the+Internet" class="Z3988" about="#mwt119" id="mwC-8"></span></span></li>
